{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-feedback","title":"AI 反馈替代人类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/rlaif/ai-feedback","wordCount":1718,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-反馈替代人类\">AI 反馈替代人类</h1><p>宪法 AI 的后半程叫 RL-CAI，它对应 RLHF 里「收集偏好标签」的那一环——只是把标注者从人换成了 AI。这一步的名字 RLAIF（Reinforcement Learning from AI Feedback）说的就是这件事：让一个模型对照宪法，判断「同一个提示的两个回答里哪个更无害」，用它的判断生成偏好标签，替代人类逐对比较。本篇讲清楚这个替换本身——反馈是怎么被 AI 生成的、格式长什么样、为什么这行得通；用这些标签训练偏好模型是 <a href=\"preference-model\">偏好模型</a> 的事，拿偏好模型做强化学习是 <a href=\"rl-cai-stage\">RL 阶段</a> 的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RLAIF 把 RLHF 里「收集偏好标签」那一环的标注者从人换成了 AI——让一个模型对照宪法，判断同一提示的两个回答哪个更无害。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI 反馈（AI feedback）</strong>：把「原始提示 + 回答 A + 回答 B + 一条随机原则改写成的问题」拼成一道多选题，模型作答即产生偏好信号。</li>\n<li><strong>软标签（soft label）</strong>：模型给出的不是硬邦邦的「A」或「B」，而是两个选项 token 的对数概率归一化后的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≻</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(A \\succ B) = \\frac{e^{\\ell_A}}{e^{\\ell_A} + e^{\\ell_B}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5032em;vertical-align:-0.4602em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0429em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5981em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8456em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.8496em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3385em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8456em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.8496em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3385em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3385em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4602em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，保留了置信度信息。</li>\n<li><strong>位置偏好抵消</strong>：把 A/B 顺序交换再问一遍取平均，抵消模型对选项位置的偏好（position bias）。</li>\n<li><strong>行得通的依据</strong>：「判断哪个回答更好」比「一次生成完美回答」容易——与自我批评同一块基石。</li>\n<li><strong>只换来源不换框架</strong>：奖励模型照样训、PPO 照样跑、KL 正则照样加；且通常只把无害性交给 AI，有用性多数仍用人类标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：RLAIF 换掉的是「谁提供偏好标签」，没换掉整个强化学习框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反馈的生成-一道多选题\">反馈的生成：一道多选题</h2><p>AI 反馈的核心动作出奇地朴素：把它写成一道多选题喂给反馈模型。具体是把「原始提示 + 回答 A + 回答 B」拼进一个模板，再追加一条随机抽取的宪法原则改写成的问题，形如「下面哪个回答更符合『选择更少有害内容的那个』这条原则？(A) … (B) …」，让模型作答。模型选 A 或 B 的相对概率，就是这一对的偏好信号。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[提示 + 回答A + 回答B] --&gt; C[反馈模板]&#10;    B[随机抽取一条宪法原则&lt;br/&gt;改写成选择题] --&gt; C&#10;    D[少样本示范] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[反馈模型输出&lt;br/&gt;A 与 B 的对数概率]&#10;    E --&gt; F[归一化为偏好概率&lt;br/&gt;软标签]&#10;    F --&gt; G[攒成 AI 偏好数据集]&#10;    G --&gt; H[训练偏好模型]\">flowchart TD\n    A[提示 + 回答A + 回答B] --&gt; C[反馈模板]\n    B[随机抽取一条宪法原则&lt;br/&gt;改写成选择题] --&gt; C\n    D[少样本示范] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[反馈模型输出&lt;br/&gt;A 与 B 的对数概率]\n    E --&gt; F[归一化为偏好概率&lt;br/&gt;软标签]\n    F --&gt; G[攒成 AI 偏好数据集]\n    G --&gt; H[训练偏好模型]</pre><p>这里和 <a href=\"../supervised/self-critique\">自我批评</a> 用同一套「随机抽原则」的设计：每道题只考一条原则，跨海量样本覆盖整部宪法。区别是批评产出「文字诊断」，反馈产出「二选一的概率」——前者用于监督阶段生成训练数据，后者用于给强化学习提供奖励信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软标签-不是选-a-b-而是取概率\">软标签：不是选 A/B，而是取概率</h2><p>一个容易被忽略但很关键的细节：反馈模型给出的不是硬邦邦的「A」或「B」，而是两个选项 token 的对数概率，归一化后得到一个介于 0 和 1 的软标签。设模型对选项 A、B 的对数概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则「A 更优」的偏好概率是一个 softmax：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>≻</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(A \\succ B) = \\frac{e^{\\ell_A}}{e^{\\ell_A} + e^{\\ell_B}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2954em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用软标签而非硬标签有实质好处：它保留了模型的置信度信息。一对回答势均力敌时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，一边明显更优时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，这种连续信号比「非黑即白」更适合训练一个平滑的偏好模型，也降低了个别误判的破坏力。为进一步稳住信号，实践中还会把 A/B 的顺序交换再问一遍取平均，抵消模型对位置的偏好（position bias）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么让-ai-打标签行得通\">为什么让 AI 打标签行得通</h2><p>把标注权交给 AI，最大的疑问是「它判断得准吗」。宪法 AI 和后续 RLAIF 研究给出的答案是：在无害性这类维度上，够准，甚至和人类标签训出的偏好模型相当。底层依据仍是那条不对称——判断哪个回答更好，比一次生成一个完美回答容易，这一点 <a href=\"../supervised/self-critique\">自我批评</a> 已作为监督阶段的基石讲过，在偏好判断上同样成立。</p>\n<p>Google 团队 2024 年发表于 ICML 的《RLAIF vs. RLHF》（Lee et al., arXiv:2309.00267）用更大规模验证了这件事：在摘要、有帮助对话、无害对话三类任务上，RLAIF 与 RLHF 表现相当；而在无害对话上，RLAIF 甚至略胜 RLHF。他们还发现，即便 AI 标注器与被训练策略同规模、甚至就是同一个检查点，RLAIF 仍能超过监督微调基线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>人类标注（RLHF）</th>\n<th>AI 反馈（RLAIF）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吞吐</td>\n<td>受人力封顶</td>\n<td>随算力扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位成本</td>\n<td>每对都要人读两段回答</td>\n<td>接近一次推理成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>标注者间主观漂移</td>\n<td>依据成文原则，标准统一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无害任务表现</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>相当或略优（Lee et al. 2024）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有用任务</td>\n<td>仍以人为准</td>\n<td>通常仍保留人类标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表把 <a href=\"../foundations/rlhf-limitations\">RLHF 的局限</a> 里讲的几堵墙，落到了「换成 AI 反馈后各维度如何变化」的具体对照上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"这一步换掉了什么-没换什么\">这一步换掉了什么，没换什么</h2><p>RLAIF 换掉的是「谁提供偏好标签」，没换掉整个强化学习框架。奖励模型照样训、PPO 照样跑、KL 正则照样加——变的只是喂给奖励模型的那批偏好数据的来源。这也是为什么 CAI 论文说自己「保留了 RLHF 的 PPO 流水线」。</p>\n<p>还有一点边界要厘清：RLAIF 里通常只把无害性偏好交给 AI，有用性偏好多数仍用人类标签，与 <a href=\"../supervised/sl-cai-stage\">监督学习阶段</a> 的数据分工一脉相承。至于奖励信号来源改变后会不会带来新的奖励攻击风险，属于机制层面的隐患，可参见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/reward-hacking\">奖励攻击 / reward hacking</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RLAIF 把 RLHF 里「人类逐对标偏好」换成「AI 对照宪法做二选一判断」，是 RL-CAI 的起点。</li>\n<li>反馈被写成一道多选题：提示+两个回答+一条随机原则，模型输出选 A/B 的对数概率。</li>\n<li>用软标签（softmax 概率）而非硬标签，保留置信度信息；交换顺序取平均以抵消位置偏好。</li>\n<li>行得通的依据是「判断比生成易」；Lee et al. 2024 大规模验证 RLAIF 与 RLHF 相当、无害任务略优。</li>\n<li>只换偏好标签来源，不换奖励模型+PPO 框架；无害交 AI、有用多仍靠人。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>用这些软标签训练偏好模型：<a href=\"preference-model\">偏好模型</a></li>\n<li>偏好模型如何驱动强化学习：<a href=\"rl-cai-stage\">RL 阶段</a></li>\n<li>同样基于「判断比生成易」的批评步骤：<a href=\"../supervised/self-critique\">自我批评</a></li>\n<li>反馈依据的原则怎么写：<a href=\"../foundations/constitution-principles\">宪法与原则</a></li>\n<li>换来源后的奖励攻击隐患：<a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/reward-modeling/reward-hacking\">奖励攻击 / reward hacking</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Bai et al., arXiv:2212.08073，§4 RL-CAI；Lee et al., <em>RLAIF vs. RLHF: Scaling Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback with AI Feedback</em>, ICML 2024, arXiv:2309.00267。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 反馈替代人类","id":"ai-反馈替代人类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"反馈的生成：一道多选题","id":"反馈的生成-一道多选题"},{"level":2,"text":"软标签：不是选 A/B，而是取概率","id":"软标签-不是选-a-b-而是取概率"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么让 AI 打标签行得通","id":"为什么让-ai-打标签行得通"},{"level":2,"text":"这一步换掉了什么，没换什么","id":"这一步换掉了什么-没换什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"监督学习阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/supervised/sl-cai-stage"},"next":{"title":"偏好模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/rlaif/preference-model"}}